maelstrom-mods (add-on content for the game maelstrom)

This is a collection of add-on content for the SDL3 port of the
game Maelstrom. Included content:

Graphics and sound mods: Star_Trek Star_Wars

Sound-only mods: Army_Of_Darkness_Sounds Beavis_Butthead_Sounds
Funky_Sounds Martin_Sounds Simpsons_Sounds Stooges_Sounds

NOTE: Only 3 of the mods from the list above can be included in
the package, due to a limitation of the Maelstrom mod selector.
By default, the included mods are:

  Star_Trek Star_Wars Simpsons_Sounds

...but you can change this by setting the MODS environment variable.
Example:

  export MODS="Army_Of_Darkness_Sounds Stooges_Sounds Star_Wars"

The slack-desc will list the mods actually included in the package.
